{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alder Forge 2 Soundtrack includes all the soundtracks the Alder Forge community will hear when playing the game. From battles, exploration, cinematics, and other encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instruments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strings: Violins, Violas, Cellos, Guitars, Harps, and Basses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys &amp; Percussion: Grand Piano, Harpsichord, Celeste, Bells, Timpani, War Drums, and Modern Percussion Sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woodwinds &amp; Brass: Oboe, Flute, English Horns, French Horns, Trombones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choirs: Soprano, Male Choir, and Female Choir</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth &amp; Electronics: Various hand-programmed synths based on the previously listed instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special: Church Organ, 8-Strings Electric Guitar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orchestration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and listeners will hear\u00a0Leitmotifs from the previous entry (The Alder Forge 1). The chord progressions and melodies that represent certain organizations, countries, or characters are kept while composing the soundtrack for the Alder Forge 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discs:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disc 1: On Launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disc 2: On Launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disc 3: TBD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disc 4: TBD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052340?t=1767983470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052340?t=1767983470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052340/890bfa35abe31f361c1a777b01bce0b2ed8a4fa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767983470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a